	(text "DQ0-7:  240 R / 150 R   0.389 / 0.423 / 0.460 V   pin current 3.1 mA max\n    limit: <= 0.47 V (VDDQ min); VREF(DQ) programmed to half the level (<= 0.225 V)\n    node source resistance 97 ohm, tau 2.6 ns: design target 100 Mb/s writes\n\nWCK_P, WCK_N:  91 R / 68 R   0.378 / 0.418 / 0.468 V per leg\n    limit: differential >= 0.30 V p-p, also with the 40 ohm WCK ODT forced during CBT\n\nWCK_P on finger 139 (N pin), WCK_N on finger 137 (P pin):\n    the host pair is driven INVERTED by the gateware.\nThe write pins are Hi-Z during reads.\nDQ0-7 are NOT delay matched on the card: die pad to ball +/-26.7 ps (F.Cu comb, the T at\nthe divider); the FPGA closes it with a per-bit output delay (design/gateware_deskew.json).\nWCK_P to WCK_N within +/-1 ps (B.Cu pair); see design/DESIGN.md section 14."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 259.08 49.53 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "d3ac6757-0875-5f7a-a797-5adea02d7eb1")
	)
